WEBVTT


00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:09.280
"A great civilization is not conquererd from without 
 until it has destroyed itself from within"  W. Durant


00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:06.440
The heart....


00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.720
...for Smoke Frog


00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.120
Thank you.


00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.280
This liver for Curl Nose.


00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.280
Thank you.


00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.320
Cocoa Leaf...


00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.680
..the ears.


00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.040
Thank you.


00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.480
And for you Blunted..


00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.800
..the balls.


00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.240
Not this again!


00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:50.640
Im helping you.


00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:51.960
Then you eat them!


00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.480
I don't need them. Neither do the rest of the fellows.


00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:55.520
Do you fellows?


00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:56.320
No.


00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.280
Of course not!


00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:58.760
Sometimes!


00:03:58.960 --> 00:03:59.760
What do you think?


00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:00.760
No!


00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:01.880
No, no!


00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.240
But how many times does it take?


00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:07.080
I have eight older sisters and one brother.


00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:10.760
Father took tapir balls all ten times.


00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.360
Shall i tell him?


00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:56.640
I'm sorry. The balls are useless.


00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.000
You never had them?


00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.800
Couldn't tell you what they taste like.


00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.880
None of you?


00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:09.480
No, but it's been fun watching you...


00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.320
This was your idea!


00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.520
Get him off me!


00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.960
Calm down!


00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.200
Why do you let them 
 treat you like this?


00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.200
Be strong.


00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.240
Where is your pride?


00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:01.440
It all works..... Yes?


00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.880
Yes...


00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:09.160
...I just can't make children.


00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.080
There is something i will tell you...


00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:21.000
..but i warn you, it's very powerful.


00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:23.440
What do you speak of?


00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:25.800
The soanzo leaf.


00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.560
The soazno leaf?


00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:31.440
From the great marshes in the south...


00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:39.280
This is what gave me my ten children.


00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:47.720
No! No! Wait...


00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.360
You have to rub them on...down there.


00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.280
Just before your next try.


00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.560
Apply it generously.


00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.200
I don't know how to thank you.


00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:08.300
If this works...maybe she'll stop bothering me.


00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.840
Your wife?


00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.120
No, her mother.


00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.840
The old hag wants grandchildren.


00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:25.800
Give me some meat.


00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:28.280
Here, work on this...


00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.520
...pure meat...


00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.480
...ball breath.


00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.440
What do you want?


00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:45.080
What do you want?


00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:45.080
I am Flint Sky. I have hunted this forest 
 from the day I came of age.


00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:51.000
My father hunted this forest 
 with me and before me.


00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.560
Jaguar Paw, my son.


00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.160
He hunts this forest with me


00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:02.160
He will hunt it with his 
 son after I am gone.


00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:23.480
A good catch?


00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:26.240
Good waters here.


00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:30.320
The forest give much here.


00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.280
We ask only to pass through.


00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.440
Pass.


00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.080
Keep safe as you pass.


00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.240
Let's go.


00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.800
Our lands were ravaged!


00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:34.560
We seek a new beginning.


00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:43.040
Your lands were ravaged?


00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.360
Yes...


00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:52.360
We seek a new beginning...


00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:54.160
Be still!


00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.320
My son!


00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:58.520
Be still.


00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:04.960
Back to the village.


00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:43.240
I ask you not to speak of what you saw in the forest today.


00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.160
You are troubled.


00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:51.120
Yes, I am.


00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:11.560
Those people in the forest, what did you see on them?


00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.240
I do not understand.


00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:15.800
Fear.


00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:22.000
Deep rotting fear.


00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.120
They were infected by it.


00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:27.240
Did you see?


00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:29.920
Fear is a sickness.


00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:39.280
It will crawl into the soul, of anyone who engages it.


00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:45.160
It has tainted your peace already.


00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:51.400
I did not raise you to see you live with fear.


00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.660
Strike it from your heart.


00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:58.450
Do not bring it into our village.


00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:02.600
At first light we will 
 gather with the elders...


00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.600
...at the sacred hill of our fathers.


00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:11.600
There we will call on their spirits to guide us.


00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.360
Oh here he is!


00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:26.600
The big lump!


00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:28.880
He's useless.


00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:31.080
He can't do it!


00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.320
You! Yes you!


00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:38.440
With your height and your girth! You have deceived us.


00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:40.720
Get inside!


00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:47.760
Damn you! Get in there!


00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.560
Old woman, please!


00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:50.920
Move it!


00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.720
You don't work!


00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.680
What are you laughing about?


00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:12.700
Give me a grandchild or I will have you replaced.


00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:16.040
Mother, that's enough.


00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:20.080
Do not come out until you make a child!


00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.240
Two would be better!


00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.400
What?


00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.040
Twins you oaf!


00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:37.480
Mother.


00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:42.720
Can you go away? He says he can't with you sitting there.


00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:44.480
Just get busy.


00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:47.040
Mom...


00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.080
She's gone.


00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:38.920
Mother, what do you say we should have at the feast tonight?


00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.880
I have tapir...but I also found this boy.


00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:43.280
I say boy.


00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:44.360
Roasted!


00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:47.240
The tapir smells better, I think it's more fresh.


00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.520
No Dad! No! It's me! It's me!


00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:52.520
I'll just hang the boy here in case we change our minds.


00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:56.780
Wait...


00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.760
That's our Turtles Run. That's our eldest.


00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:02.440
Yes it's me. It's your eldest!


00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:06.650
In that case, a crush for my eldest...


00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.440
...and a crush for my youngest.


00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:16.000
Tapir it is.


00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.750
One day, old man!


00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:25.600
One day, you won't be able to run anymore!


00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:46.420
And a Man sat alone,


00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.160
Drenched deep in sadness.


00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:53.600
And all the animals drew near to him and said:


00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:58.040
"We do not like to see you so sad...


00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:03.200
"Ask us for whatever you wish and you shall have it."


00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:08.560
The Man said: 
 "I want to have good sight."


00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:13.080
The vulture replied: "You shall have mine."


00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:19.300
The Man said: "I want to be strong."


00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.680
The jaguar said:


00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.950
"You shall be strong like me."


00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:37.680
Then the Man said: 
 "I long to know the secrets of the earth."


00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:44.160
The serpent replied: "I will show them to you."


00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.520
And so it went with all the animals.


00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:52.920
And when the Man had all the gifts that they could give...


00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.750
....he left.


00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:58.520
Then the owl said to the other animals:


00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:03.240
"Now the Man knows much, 
 he'll be able to do many things...


00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:07.680
Suddenly I am afraid."


00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:13.600
The deer said: "The Man has 
 all that he needs.


00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.730
Now his sadness will stop."


00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:19.320
But the owl replied: "No."


00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:24.800
"I saw a hole in the Man...


00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:29.500
"Deep like a hunger he will never fill...


00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:35.050
"It is what makes him sad and what makes him want."


00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:41.270
"He will go taking and taking...


00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:45.650
"Until one day the World will say:


00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:50.100
"I am no more and I have nothing left to give."


00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:38.520
Come back to me...


00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:44.700
Come back to me.


00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:15.240
My son is dancing.


00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:19.040
Your son is happy.


00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:12.500
What do you want?


00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:30.050
Run!


00:23:45.350 --> 00:23:49.440
Now that you're up, can you please kill that dog?


00:24:02.350 --> 00:24:04.450
The dog.


00:25:31.000 --> 00:25:32.690
Get up! Get up! now!


00:26:47.500 --> 00:26:49.120
Go to the forest.


00:26:49.520 --> 00:26:51.420
Run! Do not look back.


00:27:16.820 --> 00:27:18.680
No! No! I am afraid!


00:27:19.000 --> 00:27:21.080
Look into my eyes. Look into my eyes.


00:27:21.350 --> 00:27:22.450
Be strong...


00:27:22.840 --> 00:27:23.960
I am afraid!


00:27:24.520 --> 00:27:26.100
Be strong.


00:28:23.780 --> 00:28:24.680
Tie him up!


00:29:41.900 --> 00:29:42.960
Father!


00:29:44.300 --> 00:29:46.480
The others. I have to help.


00:29:47.560 --> 00:29:49.350
No, don't leave us!


00:29:49.550 --> 00:29:52.280
I will come back, I promise.


00:29:52.510 --> 00:29:53.750
Don't you leave.


00:29:54.000 --> 00:29:54.860
I promise.


00:29:54.870 --> 00:29:55.850
Stay, please stay.


00:29:56.000 --> 00:29:57.160
Father, don't go!


00:30:53.000 --> 00:30:54.520
Very nice!


00:31:40.950 --> 00:31:42.000
Stop!


00:31:50.670 --> 00:31:52.000
Tie him up!


00:31:56.260 --> 00:31:57.680
I want him alive.


00:32:17.950 --> 00:32:19.250
Sorry father.


00:32:38.100 --> 00:32:40.010
That's enough!


00:32:50.470 --> 00:32:52.240
Stand him up.


00:32:59.850 --> 00:33:01.520
Move away.


00:33:15.150 --> 00:33:16.950
My son...


00:33:27.630 --> 00:33:29.500
Don't be afraid.


00:34:27.000 --> 00:34:29.570
Almost...


00:34:44.200 --> 00:34:46.900
...that's your name.


00:34:47.760 --> 00:34:50.650
"Almost".


00:35:06.630 --> 00:35:09.120
Our life is over.


00:35:14.420 --> 00:35:15.780
Shame...


00:35:23.550 --> 00:35:24.800
Shame!


00:35:28.850 --> 00:35:31.000
Cowards!


00:39:02.000 --> 00:39:03.900
Let's move!


00:41:21.750 --> 00:41:23.160
We move out now.


00:41:23.520 --> 00:41:24.960
They are back.


00:41:27.920 --> 00:41:29.350
Get up.


00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:33.480
Heave!


00:41:40.560 --> 00:41:43.320
Cut Rock, you forgot to duck.


00:41:46.240 --> 00:41:47.570
Hold still.


00:41:57.100 --> 00:41:58.280
Can you see?


00:42:00.500 --> 00:42:01.560
Yes.


00:42:01.950 --> 00:42:03.800
Get back to your line.


00:43:04.350 --> 00:43:05.650
Come with us...


00:43:57.250 --> 00:43:58.520
Get up.


00:44:10.900 --> 00:44:13.200
Leave him alone, "Almost".


00:44:15.270 --> 00:44:17.200
I said get up.


00:44:45.340 --> 00:44:47.080
Up, up...


00:44:47.520 --> 00:44:49.120
...that's it.


00:44:51.200 --> 00:44:52.570
Let's go!


00:44:56.300 --> 00:44:59.240
This man is a good friend of yours...


00:45:33.620 --> 00:45:35.640
Don't worry...


00:45:39.100 --> 00:45:41.120
I'll take care of them...


00:45:43.800 --> 00:45:46.300
They are mine now.


00:45:53.390 --> 00:45:57.480
Gentle Ixchel. Tender mother of mercy.


00:45:59.220 --> 00:46:04.360
Keep them from harm. Please. Keep them.


00:46:44.700 --> 00:46:46.330
Hold on! Hold on!


00:46:50.160 --> 00:46:51.760
Wait...


00:46:53.240 --> 00:46:55.100
...let's see what happens.


00:47:02.900 --> 00:47:03.860
That's it!


00:47:10.950 --> 00:47:12.200
Hurry!


00:47:13.060 --> 00:47:15.080
Pull! Be strong!


00:47:33.800 --> 00:47:35.680
Yes! You did it!


00:47:39.420 --> 00:47:41.160
Good work!


00:47:53.700 --> 00:47:56.500
Can you breathe?...Good.


00:48:25.840 --> 00:48:26.810
Wait here.


00:48:59.660 --> 00:49:01.400
What's become of my capture?


00:49:05.060 --> 00:49:06.530
Dead weight.


00:49:08.150 --> 00:49:10.450
He nearly took the rest with him.


00:49:12.580 --> 00:49:14.360
I let him go.


00:49:18.460 --> 00:49:20.250
You let him go?


00:49:27.150 --> 00:49:30.700
Shall we now do what "you" want?


00:49:34.900 --> 00:49:37.900
Let us try that.


00:50:00.800 --> 00:50:03.640
Don't let any other go.


00:50:10.140 --> 00:50:11.480
Let's move.


00:50:26.160 --> 00:50:27.000
Get up "Almost".


00:50:29.660 --> 00:50:33.280
We don't want to lose you just yet.


00:51:22.700 --> 00:51:24.760
Stand up, boy.


00:51:33.360 --> 00:51:35.860
You proved yourself today, my son.


00:51:36.500 --> 00:51:40.000
Your're now worthy to stand with the rest of us.


00:51:42.780 --> 00:51:45.370
Thank you father.


00:51:55.200 --> 00:51:56.660
Take it...


00:51:57.350 --> 00:51:58.680
...it's yours.


00:52:02.500 --> 00:52:05.250
It has taken many lives.


00:52:17.440 --> 00:52:18.880
Get some rest.


00:52:33.160 --> 00:52:34.360
Resting brothers...


00:52:34.600 --> 00:52:37.920
...fathers, mothers, wives.


00:52:38.920 --> 00:52:43.080
You felt the cold of this day's early morning.


00:52:43.940 --> 00:52:48.120
Now you cannot feel the coldness of its night.


00:52:50.760 --> 00:52:52.800
She stopped screaming...


00:52:54.900 --> 00:52:57.900
...too long before they returned, she had stopped screaming.


00:52:58.660 --> 00:53:01.390
We saw how she fought them.


00:53:02.300 --> 00:53:04.220
But in the final moments?


00:53:05.700 --> 00:53:07.680
If she let them...


00:53:10.240 --> 00:53:14.900
...the Goddess of the Scaffolds 
 shows no mercy for the weak.


00:53:16.800 --> 00:53:21.300
Her soul waits for yours in the shade of the Ceiba Tree.


00:53:32.260 --> 00:53:34.100
I need to know.


00:53:35.440 --> 00:53:40.240
Before this day's end, when I leave this world.


00:53:42.000 --> 00:53:47.530
I will take as many of these 
 bastard dogs with me as I can.


00:53:49.760 --> 00:53:54.560
And I will gladly accept the tortures of hell...


00:53:56.640 --> 00:54:00.000
...if I do not find my Sky Flower there.


00:54:06.900 --> 00:54:08.400
Please don't rain.


00:54:51.160 --> 00:54:52.960
I am walking here!


00:55:25.220 --> 00:55:27.240
Keep away, she has the sickness.


00:55:52.460 --> 00:55:54.160
Get back!


00:56:46.300 --> 00:56:48.450
You fear me?


00:56:49.800 --> 00:56:52.400
So you should...


00:56:53.000 --> 00:56:56.450
...all you who are vile.


00:56:59.380 --> 00:57:03.000
Would you like to know how you will die?


00:57:09.750 --> 00:57:13.660
The sacred time is near...


00:57:15.680 --> 00:57:19.920
Beware the blackness of the day.


00:57:22.950 --> 00:57:27.760
Beware the man who brings the jaguar.


00:57:30.560 --> 00:57:35.300
Behold him, reborn from mud and earth...


00:57:36.680 --> 00:57:41.720
For the one he takes you to will cancel the sky...


00:57:43.150 --> 00:57:46.100
...and scratch out the earth.


00:57:47.050 --> 00:57:49.460
Scratch you out.


00:57:50.600 --> 00:57:53.350
And end your world.


00:57:59.700 --> 00:58:03.000
He's with us now.


00:58:09.760 --> 00:58:12.650
...day will be like night.


00:58:13.100 --> 00:58:17.650
And the man jaguar will lead you to your end.


00:59:27.650 --> 00:59:29.900
Where are they taking us?


00:59:34.100 --> 00:59:38.570
We tell stories of a place stone-built.


00:59:39.950 --> 00:59:41.650
What happens there?


00:59:42.400 --> 00:59:43.900
I do not know...


00:59:45.300 --> 00:59:48.900
...but the earth bleeds.


00:59:51.800 --> 00:59:53.800
We are near.


01:00:34.850 --> 01:00:36.500
Salvation!


01:00:37.000 --> 01:00:40.160
He has the laughing sickness.


01:00:41.000 --> 01:00:43.100
He likes you!


01:00:45.600 --> 01:00:47.000
Help me!


01:00:55.000 --> 01:00:57.000
Save me.


01:01:04.600 --> 01:01:06.300
Hey, don't touch.


01:03:44.800 --> 01:03:46.000
Welcome back.


01:03:46.950 --> 01:03:48.500
Have you been successful?


01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:50.280
Ask my son.


01:03:52.080 --> 01:03:53.440
How many captives?


01:03:53.620 --> 01:03:54.650
Deal with my son.


01:03:56.650 --> 01:03:57.750
A fair price.


01:03:59.150 --> 01:04:00.950
As always, trust me.


01:04:01.700 --> 01:04:02.400
Good.


01:04:20.000 --> 01:04:22.750
How much will you give me?


01:05:23.550 --> 01:05:25.520
Who will buy this woman?


01:05:26.500 --> 01:05:28.000
No....she's too old.


01:05:29.120 --> 01:05:31.050
She can be useful.


01:05:31.450 --> 01:05:33.200
She can cook... clean...


01:05:34.650 --> 01:05:36.760
Useless old woman!


01:05:40.300 --> 01:05:41.900
No sale.


01:05:47.500 --> 01:05:48.880
Go!


01:05:49.900 --> 01:05:51.320
Go on.


01:10:47.750 --> 01:10:52.100
These are the days of our great lament.


01:10:55.800 --> 01:10:58.400
The land thirsts.


01:11:00.700 --> 01:11:05.100
A great plague infests our crops.


01:11:07.880 --> 01:11:11.960
The scourge of sickness afflicts us at whim.


01:11:17.800 --> 01:11:21.450
They say, this strife has made us weak.


01:11:23.500 --> 01:11:25.500
That we have become empty.


01:11:28.150 --> 01:11:30.450
They say, that we rot.


01:11:41.900 --> 01:11:44.800
Great people of the banner of the sun...


01:11:45.550 --> 01:11:47.150
I say...


01:11:48.200 --> 01:11:50.150
...we are strong!


01:11:54.400 --> 01:11:56.600
We are a people of destiny.


01:12:01.200 --> 01:12:04.700
Destined to be the masters of time.


01:12:08.400 --> 01:12:11.800
Destined to be nearest to the gods.


01:12:27.400 --> 01:12:30.650
Mighty KuKulKan!


01:12:32.000 --> 01:12:36.700
Whose fury could scorch this earth to oblivion...


01:12:39.150 --> 01:12:41.550
Let us appease you with this sacrifice.


01:12:42.050 --> 01:12:43.930
To exalt you in your glory.


01:12:44.700 --> 01:12:47.350
To make our people prosper.


01:12:48.350 --> 01:12:51.120
To prepare for your return.


01:12:54.050 --> 01:12:56.900
Warrior, unafraid and willing!


01:12:57.350 --> 01:12:59.750
With your blood you renew the world!


01:13:00.100 --> 01:13:02.050
From age to age.


01:13:03.370 --> 01:13:05.080
Thanks be to you.


01:13:19.500 --> 01:13:21.780
The heart of god!


01:16:03.000 --> 01:16:05.300
Come back to me.


01:16:14.000 --> 01:16:16.000
Brother...


01:16:17.750 --> 01:16:19.600
Journey well...


01:16:21.700 --> 01:16:22.700
No.


01:16:24.000 --> 01:16:25.300
I can't go.


01:16:26.650 --> 01:16:28.350
Not now...


01:18:45.950 --> 01:18:50.850
People of the banner of the sun, do not fear.


01:18:51.670 --> 01:18:53.550
Rejoice!


01:18:54.700 --> 01:18:57.800
Kukulkan has drunk his fill of blood.


01:18:58.020 --> 01:19:00.880
We have sated his thirst.


01:19:02.000 --> 01:19:03.680
Great god.


01:19:04.640 --> 01:19:06.850
Show us that you are pleased.


01:19:07.050 --> 01:19:10.680
Let your light return upon us.


01:20:15.000 --> 01:20:17.150
What of these captives?


01:20:21.700 --> 01:20:23.650
Dispose of them.


01:20:57.550 --> 01:20:59.800
I need a finisher.


01:21:04.650 --> 01:21:06.050
You.


01:21:11.950 --> 01:21:13.550
Release them.


01:21:21.600 --> 01:21:23.370
You watch.


01:21:43.800 --> 01:21:45.050
I'm ready!


01:21:49.840 --> 01:21:52.850
There's your jungle, beyond the corn.


01:21:55.700 --> 01:21:57.200
Go to it.


01:21:57.900 --> 01:21:59.340
You're free...


01:22:01.050 --> 01:22:02.560
....now run.


01:22:05.700 --> 01:22:07.100
I said run!


01:22:11.400 --> 01:22:12.760
Run!


01:23:25.300 --> 01:23:26.450
Not bad.


01:23:44.250 --> 01:23:45.680
Your turn.


01:23:53.300 --> 01:23:54.920
Run.


01:25:09.560 --> 01:25:11.210
Run!


01:26:24.600 --> 01:26:26.200
Sleep.


01:26:27.100 --> 01:26:29.350
Sleep now my son.


01:26:30.390 --> 01:26:32.750
The pain will be no more.


01:26:34.620 --> 01:26:35.950
Sleep.


01:32:21.050 --> 01:32:23.280
He didn't come this way.


01:32:36.300 --> 01:32:38.320
He's in the trees.


01:32:39.950 --> 01:32:41.300
Spread out.


01:32:42.050 --> 01:32:43.650
Keep your eyes open.


01:33:05.650 --> 01:33:06.780
Quite.


01:33:18.140 --> 01:33:19.420
He's coming right at us.


01:33:35.850 --> 01:33:36.560
There!


01:35:33.020 --> 01:35:35.840
He would have wanted me to have it.


01:35:37.840 --> 01:35:40.810
The omen is bad...


01:35:42.670 --> 01:35:45.770
Mighty Ek Chuah, we beg you...


01:35:46.940 --> 01:35:51.170
Forgive us for this trespass 
 against your son, the jaguar.


01:35:53.100 --> 01:35:55.600
The omen is bad...


01:35:57.300 --> 01:35:59.300
Lift yourself up Drunkards Four...


01:36:00.040 --> 01:36:03.130
...the omen was foretold...


01:36:05.400 --> 01:36:08.610
...and now we have a fear more grave...


01:36:09.500 --> 01:36:12.910
...today I saw the day become like night...


01:36:19.300 --> 01:36:22.920
I saw a man run with the jaguar...


01:36:26.750 --> 01:36:30.850
...we must not let this man make feet from us.


01:36:31.500 --> 01:36:32.720
Enough!


01:36:36.380 --> 01:36:38.280
Your words mean nothing.


01:36:39.580 --> 01:36:41.900
He runs, because he is afraid.


01:36:43.050 --> 01:36:47.000
When I catch him, I will peel his skin...


01:36:49.700 --> 01:36:52.500
...and have him watch me wear it.


01:37:00.000 --> 01:37:01.330
We leave now!


01:39:25.700 --> 01:39:27.000
Here!


01:39:51.000 --> 01:39:53.250
The omen was bad...


01:39:56.750 --> 01:39:58.000
He's fucked.


01:40:01.100 --> 01:40:02.700
Help...please...


01:40:03.400 --> 01:40:04.750
Hanging Moss...


01:40:06.300 --> 01:40:08.000
...see him out.


01:40:28.100 --> 01:40:31.800
Open your veins. It's quicker.


01:40:44.300 --> 01:40:46.450
Travel well.


01:43:49.600 --> 01:43:52.450
So much for you prophecies.


01:43:58.120 --> 01:43:59.420
It's not over!


01:44:25.000 --> 01:44:26.700
I am Jaguar Paw...


01:44:27.300 --> 01:44:28.970
Son of Flint Sky!


01:44:30.250 --> 01:44:33.700
My father hunted this forest before me...


01:44:35.340 --> 01:44:37.350
My name is Jaguar Paw!


01:44:38.050 --> 01:44:39.780
I am a hunter!


01:44:41.200 --> 01:44:43.600
This is my forest!


01:44:44.600 --> 01:44:49.200
And my sons will hunt it with their 
 sons after I am gone!


01:44:51.940 --> 01:44:53.220
Come on!


01:44:54.100 --> 01:44:55.000
Come on!


01:44:55.750 --> 01:44:57.530
We are going over.


01:44:58.050 --> 01:45:00.800
We climb down around.


01:45:02.000 --> 01:45:04.130
We cannot let him get away.


01:45:04.700 --> 01:45:05.930
We cannot afford...


01:45:25.800 --> 01:45:28.000
We all jump.


01:48:22.500 --> 01:48:24.200
I am Jaguar Paw.


01:48:25.950 --> 01:48:27.850
This is my forest.


01:48:29.820 --> 01:48:32.530
And I am not afraid.


01:50:38.120 --> 01:50:40.700
You go i'll wait here.


01:56:05.500 --> 01:56:07.350
Almost...


01:56:33.750 --> 01:56:36.500
Resting fathers, fly me your strength.


01:57:03.100 --> 01:57:04.880
Get up here.


01:57:19.500 --> 01:57:21.130
Go back!


01:57:50.000 --> 01:57:50.800
Quick!


01:57:51.360 --> 01:57:52.360
Hurry up!


02:04:13.570 --> 02:04:15.480
What are they?


02:04:17.050 --> 02:04:19.000
They bring men.


02:04:23.420 --> 02:04:25.400
Should we go to them?


02:04:33.500 --> 02:04:35.370
We should go to the forest.


02:04:42.100 --> 02:04:44.050
To seek a new beginning.


02:04:49.000 --> 02:04:50.520
Come Turtles Run.


